# Project Context Evolution Skill

## Purpose

Maintain this project's agent context without depending on the central full skill or seed.

## Use When

- updating `AGENTS.md`
- recording lessons
- recording failure patterns
- processing user corrections
- adding regression cases
- refreshing stale project context

## Procedure

1. Identify trigger.
2. Separate fact from interpretation.
3. Record lessons or corrections.
4. Add regression cases when recurrence is plausible.
5. Update `AGENTS.md` only for central, frequent rules.
6. Preserve project independence.
